IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `snap-core`

-- Food and Nutrition Act of 2008 (7 U.S.C. ch. 51), section 2020(e), paragraphs (14) to (26): what the State plan of operation must provide (continued).
-- LAYER 1 (the law, objectively). Same reading of results as snap4-s2020-a-d.l4: JUST TRUE / JUST FALSE / NOTHING.
-- The text is the converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text.

§ `s 2020(e)(14) to (26)`

DECLARE `s 2020(e)(14) item of a disaster plan` IS ONE OF
    `s 2020(e)(14) procedures for informing the public about the disaster program and how to apply for its benefits`
    `s 2020(e)(14) coordination with Federal and private disaster relief agencies and local government officials`
    `s 2020(e)(14) application procedures to reduce hardship and inconvenience and deter fraud`
    `s 2020(e)(14) instruction of caseworkers in procedures for implementing and operating the disaster program`
    `s 2020(e)(14) any other item`

-- src:1530 | (14) that the State agency shall specify a plan of operation for providing supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits for households that are victims of a disaster; that such plan shall include, but not be limited to, procedures for informing the public about the disaster program and how to apply for its benefits, coordination with Federal and private disaster relief agencies and local government officials, application procedures to reduce hardship and inconvenience and deter fraud, and instruction of caseworkers in procedures for implementing and operating the disaster program;
-- jural: households that are victims of a disaster | the State agency | claim and duty: a plan of operation for providing benefits to them
@ref s 2020(e)(14) (src:1530)
GIVEN `the item` IS A `s 2020(e)(14) item of a disaster plan`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2020(e)(14) the State agency's disaster plan must include the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the item`
    WHEN `s 2020(e)(14) any other item` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "such plan shall include, but not be limited to"
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:1531 | (15) notwithstanding paragraph (8) of this subsection, for the immediate reporting to the Immigration and Naturalization Service by the State agency of a determination by personnel responsible for the certification or recertification of households that any member of a household is ineligible to receive supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits because that member is present in the United States in violation of the Immigration and Nationality Act [8 U.S.C. 1101 et seq.];
-- jural: the Immigration and Naturalization Service | the State agency | claim and duty: immediate report of a household member found present in violation of the Immigration and Nationality Act, notwithstanding paragraph (8)
@ref s 2020(e)(15) (src:1531)
GIVEN `certification or recertification personnel have determined that a member of a household is ineligible to receive benefits because the member is present in the United States in violation of the Immigration and Nationality Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2020(e)(15) the State agency must immediately report the member to the Immigration and Naturalization Service` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `certification or recertification personnel have determined that a member of a household is ineligible to receive benefits because the member is present in the United States in violation of the Immigration and Nationality Act` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a determination by personnel responsible for the certification or recertification of households that any member of a household is ineligible ... because that member is present in the United States in violation of the Immigration and Nationality Act"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:1532 | (16) at the option of the State agency, for the establishment and operation of an automatic data processing and information retrieval system that meets such conditions as the Secretary may prescribe and that is designed to provide efficient and effective administration of the supplemental nutrition assistance program;
