            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "at the option of the State agency, that information may be requested and exchanged ... in accordance with a State system which meets the requirements of section 1137"
            OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref s 2020(e)(17) (src:1533)
GIVEN `s 2012(s) the body is a State agency` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `section 303(d) of the Social Security Act permits the request and use` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2020(e)(17) the State agency may request and use additional information from the agency administering State unemployment compensation laws` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2012(s) the body is a State agency`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the body is the State agency of section 2012(s)(1) is answered by section 2012(s)
    WHEN JUST isAgency THEN
