        IF `the State agency obtains information collected under section 1611(e)(1)(I)(i)(I) of the Social Security Act pursuant to section 1611(e)(1)(I)(ii)(II) of that Act` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the State agency obtains information under another program determined by the Secretary to be comparable to the program carried out under that section` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
